  "text": "FAMILY WORKSPACE\nCare\nCaregivers\nMessages\nRequest care\nMB\nMaria Bennett\nFamily\nMy care\n/\nRecurring care\n\nRECURRING CARE\n\nRecurring care for Eleanor Bennett\n\nMon, Wed, Fri · 10:00 AM–12:00 PM · Raleigh, NC\n\nFinding a caregiver\nRequest #34\nGet help\nCare story\nOverview\nCaregivers\nVisits\nCare details\n\nCAREGIVER REPLIES\n\nReview replies below\n\nOpen profile details only when you need more context. The main actions stay on each caregiver card.\n\nInvite someone\nFilter or sort caregivers\nStatus\nAll caregivers\nInterested\nSaved\nHired\nDeclined\nNot selected\nWithdrawn\nSort\nLatest first\nOldest first\nRate high-low\nRate low-high\nCertifications & training\nAny\n⌄\nRequired certifications & training\n\nChoose what the caregiver must currently have. Select more than one to require all of them.\n\nCPR\nFirst Aid\nBasic Life Support (BLS)\nCertified Nursing Assistant (CNA)\nHome Health Aide (HHA)\nPersonal Care Aide (PCA)\nMedication Aide or Technician\nDementia care training\nOther certification or training\n\n4 caregivers match the applicant filters\n\nCaregivers who replied\n\nReview their reply, profile, or start a conversation.\n\nSM\n\nSofia Martinez\n\nSaved\n\nRaleigh, NC\n\n7 years experience\n4.9\n24 reviews\nReliability 98%\nProfile details\nIdentity verified\nBackground check\nTop Caregiver\nAccepting clients\n\nI enjoy helping older adults keep a familiar routine, prepare meals, and stay connected.\n\nCompanionship\nMeal preparation\nLight housekeeping\n\nLanguages: English\n\nI am available for your schedule and would love to help Ellie with her everyday routine.\n\nHire Sofia\nView profile\nStart chat\nMore options for Sofia\nSave for later\nNot this caregiver\nJW\n\nJames Wilson\n\nInterested\n\nRaleigh, NC\n\n5 years experience\n4.8\n18 reviews\nReliability 98%\nProfile details\nIdentity verified\nBackground check\nTop Caregiver\nAccepting clients\n\nPatient, dependable support with companionship, everyday tasks, and gentle encouragement.\n\nCompanionship\nMeal preparation\nLight housekeeping\n\nLanguages: English\n\nI am available for your schedule and would love to help Ellie with her everyday routine.\n\nHire James\nView profile\nSave & chat\nMore options for James\nSave for later\nNot this caregiver\nAR\n\nAisha Robinson\n\nInterested\n\nRaleigh, NC\n\n9 years experience\n5.0\n31 reviews\nReliability 98%\nProfile details\nIdentity verified\nBackground check\nTop Caregiver\nAccepting clients\n\nI bring a calm approach to home support and take time to understand each person.\n\nCompanionship\nMeal preparation\nLight housekeeping\n\nLanguages: English\n\nI am available for your schedule and would love to help Ellie with her everyday routine.\n\nHire Aisha\nView profile\nSave & chat\nMore options for Aisha\nSave for later\nNot this caregiver\nOC\n\nOliver Chen\n\nInterested\n\nRaleigh, NC\n\n4 years experience\n4.8\n12 reviews\nReliability 98%\nProfile details\nIdentity verified\nBackground check\nTop Caregiver\nAccepting clients\n\nFriendly and dependable companionship, everyday meal preparation, and help around the home.\n\nCompanionship\nMeal preparation\nLight housekeeping\n\nLanguages: English\n\nI am available for your schedule and would love to help Ellie with her everyday routine.\n\nHire Oliver\nView profile\nSave & chat\nMore options for Oliver\nSave for later\nNot this caregiver\n\nLOOKING FOR A SPECIFIC PERSON?\n\nInvite someone you know\n\nSearch by name and invite them without leaving this request or choosing the request again.\n\nSearch and invite\nPeople you invited\n\nInvitations are separate from caregivers who replied.\n\n0 total\nNo active invitations yet.\nRecommended caregivers\n\nKeep reviewing replies above, or invite another matching caregiver if no one feels right yet.\n\nER\n\nE2E Ready Caregiver\n\nSame ZIP service area - Match score 118\n\n4.9\n14 reviews\nIdentity verified\nBackground check\nTop caregiver\nCPR\n · \nReported by caregiver\nMemory 